<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12459" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόδημ-ος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδήμ-δᾱμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>away from one's country, abroad,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀ. Ἀπόλλωνος τυχόντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.799f
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐπέρχεσθαι</span>
			<i>from abroad</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3344
			</span></i>
			<u>A</u> (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. στρατεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐμῆς γνώμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			:—less 
				Att.
			 than <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκδημος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Moer.
				143
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.177
			</span></i>.</div>
